"This plugin allows you to create reusable WPBakery templates that can be "
"quickly inserted into your site. However, if you need to assign the same "
"template to multiple sections across your site, it's better to use %sDynamic "
"Templates%s for greater global control."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin/recommended-plugins.php:193
msgid ""
"This is a bundled premium plugin for creating complex pages and templates. If "
"you prefer using Elementor, Total is fully compatible with it—just keep this "
"plugin disabled and activate Elementor instead."
msgstr ""

